1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,029
11 days.

2
00:00:01,029 --> 00:00:01,926
No sleep,

3
00:00:01,926 --> 00:00:03,199
at all.

4
00:00:03,199 --> 00:00:04,857
This is the record of a high school kid,

5
00:00:04,857 --> 00:00:06,601
back in 1964.

6
00:00:06,861 --> 00:00:08,810
His name: Randy Gardner,

7
00:00:08,810 --> 00:00:09,616
17,

8
00:00:09,616 --> 00:00:10,766
from San Diego.

9
00:00:10,766 --> 00:00:13,486
It was his school science fair project.

10
00:00:13,486 --> 00:00:14,666
And he was watched

11
00:00:14,666 --> 00:00:16,818
by a sleep researcher from Stanford.

12
00:00:17,078 --> 00:00:18,143
The result?

13
00:00:18,143 --> 00:00:19,369
By day four,

14
00:00:19,369 --> 00:00:20,863
he was hallucinating.

15
00:00:20,863 --> 00:00:21,976
He couldn't focus,

16
00:00:21,976 --> 00:00:23,096
got irritable,

17
00:00:23,096 --> 00:00:25,336
his memory full of holes.

18
00:00:25,336 --> 00:00:26,138
Strangely,

19
00:00:26,138 --> 00:00:27,368
he could still play basketball

20
00:00:27,368 --> 00:00:28,568
and pinball.

21
00:00:28,828 --> 00:00:30,046
Here's the thing:

22
00:00:30,046 --> 00:00:32,378
after just 17 hours awake,

23
00:00:32,378 --> 00:00:33,493
your performance drops

24
00:00:33,493 --> 00:00:36,159
to the level of someone with a blood alcohol level

25
00:00:36,159 --> 00:00:38,736
of 0.05%.

26
00:00:38,736 --> 00:00:40,828
That's a study published in Nature.

27
00:00:41,088 --> 00:00:43,241
It's like a phone at 5% battery.

28
00:00:43,241 --> 00:00:44,041
Still on,

29
00:00:44,041 --> 00:00:46,161
but every app lags.

30
00:00:46,161 --> 00:00:47,251
Can you use it?

31
00:00:47,251 --> 00:00:47,999
Sure.

32
00:00:47,999 --> 00:00:49,799
Can you rely on it?

33
00:00:49,799 --> 00:00:51,046
Not really.

34
00:00:51,306 --> 00:00:52,209
After the record,

35
00:00:52,209 --> 00:00:54,176
Randy slept about 14 hours,

36
00:00:54,176 --> 00:00:55,297
and recovered.

37
00:00:55,297 --> 00:00:55,921
But today,

38
00:00:55,921 --> 00:00:58,617
Guinness won't record attempts like this anymore.

39
00:00:58,617 --> 00:00:59,730
Too dangerous.

40
00:00:59,990 --> 00:01:03,326
Adults need at least 7 hours of sleep a night.

41
00:01:03,326 --> 00:01:03,587
So,

42
00:01:03,587 --> 00:01:04,894
are you getting enough,

43
00:01:04,894 --> 00:01:06,407
or not quite?

44
00:01:06,407 --> 00:01:09,807
Tell us in the comments.

